Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:12:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mprapi: information blocks, error strings, local router
 configuration

MprInfo* (Create, Delete, Duplicate, RemoveAll, BlockAdd/Set/Remove/Find/
QuerySize) build and edit router information blocks (header, table of contents,
4-byte aligned blocks). MprAdminGetErrorString returns text for the router
error codes. MprConfigServerConnect gives a handle for the local machine whose
interface and transport lists are empty; remote servers and the router admin
connection fail with RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE and MprAdminIsServiceRunning
queries the RemoteAccess service. The other 70 router/MIB/admin entry points
get their real argument counts and fail with ERROR_INVALID_HANDLE (no handle
can exist) or ERROR_CALL_NOT_IMPLEMENTED. Nothing changes the network.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
